@Time Duration:	17:30-18:30
@Situation:	diary for nina52: nina had four of her friend visiting at her house today. one little girl , elizabeth , is still there. she has been staying at nina's house since friday. elizabeth and nina go to the same day+care center. nina is quite tired. she becomes very cranky as the taping session progresses. elizabeth's utterances will be preceded by "e" to distinguish them from nina's. elizabeth and nina are playing in nina's room with the doll house. they are playing with various wooden people and pieces of doll house furniture which they place in the doll house.
@Types:	long, toyplay, TD
